            <ArticleTitle>Acute pain services: a new career direction for postanesthesia nurses.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>321-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative pain management continues to be a challenge to health care professionals. To address this, hospitals across the country are developing Acute Pain Services. It is fast becoming a specialty area and is being incorporated into the realm of practice of anesthesiologists. As postanesthesia nurses, we are in a unique position to enter this new field.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
